00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,600
You can't do it anymore.

33
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:21,000
So that is the heart of the difference

34
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,420
between fixed and sub-cost.

35
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:24,960
Sub-cost, you can't get your money back.

36
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,240
Of course, when you think about it,

