00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:00,800
yes, it's sunk off.

54
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,800
Yeah, then it's sunk too, yes.

55
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,000
So even if the payments are in the future.

56
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:04,840
Yes, yeah, exactly.

57
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,680
There's no way to get your money back.

58
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,520
But if you,

59
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,480
in the real world, of course,

60
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,360
you could just go bankrupt or whatever, or run away.

61
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,960
So then you would say at least the future payments

