00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:26,360
then again, then it becomes sunk.

68
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:29,280
But anyway, so real world continuous variable,

69
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:32,080
but for purposes of doing the modeling,

70
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:34,840
just think about it as either fixed or sunk.

71
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,360
So what if we have a sunk cost of A

