00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,360
but not all fixed costs are sunk.

75
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,280
And then it does change,

76
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,240
at least on the surface it changes things,

77
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:51,320
because if the,

