00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:59,400
then if the entrant comes in,

80
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,880
the entrant realizes, wait a second,

81
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:04,160
well, if I come in, I'm gonna have to pay A as well,

