00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,600
I wouldn't advise that, because remember,

115
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,920
I already paid my sunk cost, so I'm here for good.

116
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,600
And if you come in here,

117
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,640
you can't count on prices staying high.

118
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,640
Instead, prices are going to go low.

119
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,280
And so even though I'm making,

120
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:32,080
even though one firm's making a profit,

121
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:34,000
two firms will both be making losses.

122
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:37,360
So you better just let me stay here being a monopolist,

