00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,560
making money hand over fist forever.

124
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,400
Tough luck.

125
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:43,040
I mean, wouldn't you like to have been the first firm,

126
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,920
but you weren't.

127
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,840
Yes.

128
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:48,040
Do situations described as natural monopolies usually

